Subject: mcvert.shar -- Convert MacBinary to/from BinHex4,Data,Rsrc,TextDate: Sun, 14 Jan 90 12:36:57 PSTFrom: trewitt@miasma.stanford.eduThis is version 1.5 of mcvert, a program to convert MacBinary files ona Un*x host to or from BinHex 4.0, raw Data files, raw Resource files,or Text files.  When converting from BinHex 4.0 to MacBinary,mcvert can optionally unpack PackIt files.This version fixes a number of bugs since the version 1.0.  The authoris Doug Moore, now at Rice University.This should be named mcvert.shar, and replace hqx-to-bin.shar, which isversion 1.0.	- Glenn